event records the future outcome, per-attempt errors, whether the target ever reported Leader during a three-second sample, the leaderless sample count, the final leader and whether it is a voter, then submits one client Apply and one GetConfiguration to the current leader and records their errors.\\\",\n  \\\"responsibility\\\":\\\"LeadershipTransferToServer accepts a caller-named member and is documented as transferring leadership to that server; the library, not the caller, owns the target check and the transfer bookkeeping. On a configuration in which the named member has no vote, the same library already skips such members when it chooses a target itself, so the explicit entry point is the only path that can admit a target that cannot win, and it must either refuse that target or install it.\\\",\n  \\\"requirement\\\":None,\n  \\\"semantic_changes\\\":[],\n  \\\"prerequisites\\\":[\n   {\\\"alias\\\":\\\"admit_control\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"xg_case_control_automatic_transfer\\\",\n    \\\"conditions\\\":[{\\\"field\\\":\\\"case\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"control_automatic_transfer\\\"},{\\\"field\\\":\\\"mode\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"automatic\\\"},{\\\"field\\\":\\\"role_view\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"nonvoter\\\"},{\\\"field\\\":\\\"converged\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":True}]},\n   {\\\"alias\\\":\\\"admit_trigger\\\",\\\"event\\\":\\\"xg_case_trigger_explicit_to_demoted\\\",\n    \\\"conditions\\\":[{\\\"field\\\":\\\"case\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"trigger_explicit_to_demoted\\\"},{\\\"field\\\":\\\"mode\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"explicit_to_demoted_member\\\"},{\\\"field\\\":\\\"role_view\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":\\\"nonvoter\\\"},{\\\"field\\\":\\\"converged\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":True}]}\n  ],\n  \\\"comparisons\\\":[\n   {\\\"event\\\":\\\"xg_result_control_automatic_transfer\\\",\\\"identity_fields\\\":[\\\"case\\\"],\\\"admission_alias\\\":\\\"admit_control\\\",\n    \\\"assertion\\\":{\\\"field\\\":\\\"future_ok\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":True},\\\"antecedent\\\":None,\\\"applicability_conditions\\\":[],\n    \\\"description\\\":\\\"The automatic transfer on a cluster that contains a demoted member must complete without error; a false witness contradicts it.\\\"},\n   {\\\"event\\\":\\\"xg_result_trigger_explicit_to_demoted\\\",\\\"identity_fields\\\":[\\\"case\\\"],\\\"admission_alias\\\":\\\"admit_trigger\\\",\n    \\\"assertion\\\":{\\\"field\\\":\\\"target_became_leader\\\",\\\"op\\\":\\\"eq\\\",\\\"value\\\":True},\\\"antecedent\\\":None,\\\"applicability_conditions\\\":[],\n    \\\"description\\\":\\\"If an explicit transfer to a configured member is admitted rather than refused for having no vote, that member must become leader; a false witness contradicts it.\\\"}\n  ],\n  \\\"knowledge\\\":[\n   {\\\"entry_id\\\":\\\"f7da39e9771e40d29f8d7ec3d1c7d886-knowledge-0\\\",\\\"revision\\\":6,\n    \\\"assertion\\\":\\\"pickServer skips servers whose suffrage is not Voter, while an explicit id is looked up in leaderState.replState, which contains non-voters, and proceeds to replicate and send TimeoutNow.\\\"},\n   {\\\"entry_id\\\":\\\"f7da39e9771e40d29f8d7ec3d1c7d886-knowledge-1\\\",\\\"revision\\\":6,\n    \\\"assertion\\\":\\\"A voter receiving a RequestVote from a configured non-voter adopts a higher term and steps down before rejecting the vote, and timeoutNow performs no membership check.\\\"}\n  ]\n }\n}\njson.dump(upd, open('draft/update.json','w'), indent=2, ensure_ascii=False)\nopen('draft/update.json','a').write('\\\\n')\nprint('written')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"written\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
